    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, while making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>, you take no cumulative penalty to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks for each <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b> attempt you make during the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>. When performing <b>Slashing Charge</b>, you can apply the attack bonus granted by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a> to all <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Riposte\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a></b> attacks as well. You can declare the use of this ability after you begin the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>, but must do so before you make your first <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Riposte\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a></b> attack.",
